`,y.jsx(f.p,{children:"By the end of this week I also got access to the Echelon Reflect Mirror repo on GitHub, the Jira board with all the tickets, and the Zeplin project with all app designs. Setting up the right Android Studio and Gradle versions took some troubleshooting, but I finally got the project running on my machine, so that’s definitely progress!"}),`
`,y.jsx(f.p,{children:"This means my work with Echelon has officially started as I claimed my first ticket and created a branch to develop on. Right now, I am working on the EchelonAI Class Card UI. The project setup is still giving me a hard time, with some strange errors, but I’m sure we’ll sort it out in the coming week."}),`
